       carries the identical package set (Hyland.Unity, Serilog) for the same reasons.
       Package versions/pins for the MVC stack (Antlr/WebGrease especially) copied from
       Samples.MvcWebPortal, an already-validated known-good combination for this
       environment. See LectureNotes.md for the session-state design and other decisions. -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <Configuration Condition=" '$(Configuration)' == '' ">Debug</Configuration>
